# An inherited class-typed static, resolved through two levels of imported
# class. `Local.W` resolves to `Top`'s static even though the consumer names
# only `Mid`, so the import must carry `Widget`'s concrete struct type — and
# `Top` is reconstructed before `Widget`, which is neither its ancestor nor
# alphabetically before it. Statics therefore cannot be imported while
# reconstruction is still running.
# name          dir    deps          root
@test/glib      lib    -
main            app    @test/glib    root
